  "body": "Fixes this issue with the radiobutton group for scale\r\n<img width=\"431\" height=\"340\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-26 at 17 39 51\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/58e9f6f2-79e9-443b-ada7-a7bda7a1ceaf\" />\r\n\r\nThe reason is that the radiobutton group lives inside a flex \"column\" div, and the radiobutton group does nothing to prevent growing to full width here (even when fullWidth is default/false). \r\n\r\nWe could also fix it in RadioButtonGroup by setting `align-self: self-start;` when fullWidth is false/default but not sure that is the best default behavior? ",
  "changed_files": 1,
  "closed_at": "2026-08-28T18:49:52Z",
